OL,3,GNEWSADecorated shipping containers
OL,4,Acould replace demolished toilets
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrightly-decorated shipping containers
OL,7,Fcould be used to replace a toilet block
OL,8,Fwhich is being demolished to make way
OL,9,Ffor a multi-million pound flood scheme.
OL,11,FThe building on the Whitesands in
OL,12,FDumfries is being taken down to allow
OL,13,Fnew protection measures to be put in
OL,14,Fplace next to the River Nith.
OL,16,FPlans have been lodged to put shipping
OL,17,Fcontainers in the New Bazaar car park
OL,18,Fon the opposite side of the road to
OL,19,Freplace the present provision.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
